request.description:
Get list of users that can be mentioned in admin_supplier scope comments.

**Returns:**
- `admins`: Array of all admins (including sub-admins) related to the folder item
- `suppliers`: Array of supplier admins (not sub-suppliers)

**Response format:**
```json
{
  "data": {
    "admins": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Admin User",
        "email": "admin@example.com",
        "type": "admin",
        "profile_photo": "https://..."
      }
    ],
    "suppliers": [
      {
        "id": 5,
        "name": "Supplier Admin",
        "email": "supplier@example.com",
        "type": "supplier",
        "profile_photo": "https://..."
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

**Note:** Only users with access to the folder item's project are included.

